ricked her finger on a spinning  wheel and fell into a deep sleep the  fairy godmother saved her from a  terrible fate when she was young but she  still won't open her eyes until she is  saved by a kiss of true love from a  prince her beauty was enough for Phillip  to do everything to save her and they  lived happily ever after  we have to admit that we are a little  bit jealous we would love to spend our  college years sleeping all the time  until the love of our life is here to  wake us up when things be much easier we  think so  Paul Westover for college humor  reimagined Aurora as a young woman who  was always late to class because she  never wakes up in the morning her  teachers are used to seeing her arrive  late to class but she always has a good  excuse she is the only one who can say  that she has been cursed when she was  still a baby  snow-white she was the youngest Disney  Princess  so it seems like she skipped a couple of  years in school to get there and we  understand why life wasn't easy for Snow  White  her stepmother was jealous of her beauty  so she dressed her up in rags and forced  her to work as a servant this is how the  young princess learned many things like  how to clean the house cook delicious  food and wash the dishes this is  something we wish we learned in high  school before going to college and this  is also what saved Snow White when she  offered to work for the Seven Dwarfs in  exchange for a place to stay we bet that  her prince was also happy to see that  this young woman was already really  independent the princess has always been  a hard worker and now she doesn't want  to be the fairest of them all but the  smartest no matter what time of the day  it is you can see Snow White studying to  get the best grades young eighty-six  reimagine as a simple girl who loves to  sing in the school choir during her free  time she is working on her computer and  she loves Apple products having the  chance to take care of her appearance  doesn't hurt either we can say that this  young woman  got the beauty and the brain mulan after  working as a soldier we can say that  this girl is ready for anything but  going to college is not going to be as  easy as she might think  Malone's family expected her to marry a  man and become a housewife but when it  was time for her to show what she could  do we understood that this was clearly  not the place for her the young woman  decided to break the rules instead and  dressed up as a man to join the army  things weren't easy there either  but at least she had the motivation to  work hard because she knew that she was  doing something important and this is  how she defeated all odds and became a  true hero after going to a private  school for boys only Mulan finally has  the opportunity to be whoever she wants  to be in college she still loves  dressing up but she doesn't have to hide  who she is  as Paul Westover for college humor  reimagined her it's hard to feel like  you don't fit in but this college  student doesn't care about being popular  the only thing that's important for her  is the love for herself and Mulan knows  that no one can take it away from her  and we think that li Shang will love  this idea too because he won't be able  to keep himself from falling in love  with this unique woman Tiana  the young girl always wanted to open her  restaurant with her father he told her  that wishing was one thing but she also  had to work hard when he passed away  Tiana knew that she would have to work  harder than ever to make her dreams come  true working as a waitress she did her  best to save the money she needed to  start her own business but a man or we  should say a frog decided to make things  much more complicated everyone was happy  at the end but we still can't believe  Tiana had to go through this to open her  restaurant not a lot of people can do  that and we think that in college Tiana  will be stronger than ever she is not  only studying to become the greatest  cook but she is also working part-time  during the weekend  if this girl has one thing on her mind  you can be sure that nothing will stop  her not even the fact that there are  only 24 hours in a day however there is  one thing that can be a major  distraction for tea  as Renzo Ferreira imagined her she just  loves boys and wants to make sure that  she gets their attention if her father  wouldn't approve then naveen's no good  for her  Kiana should focus on school if she  really wants to open her own restaurant  any time soon Moana if there is one  thing that has always fascinated this  young girl it is the ocean she always  wanted to travel the sea even if her  parents kept stopping her from realizing  her dream but what she didn't know was  that she was actually the only one who  had the power to save her tribe and when  she learned about this she was  courageous enough to leave on her own on  a boat to meet the demigod Maui it  wasn't only a quest to find the mystical  heart that was stolen but also for Moana  to find out who she truly was even if  things were difficult and that she  wanted to give up the young woman  finally realized that there was a reason  why she was chosen and she came back to  save the world in the 21st century mo  Anna's parents probably weren't happy to  learn that she wanted to leave the tribe  to go to college but she did it anyway  and is now studying theology as young  sixty-eight reimagined her lawanna loves  mythology legends and fables  and wants to one day become the hero of  her own story it is not easy for her to  be separated from her family for such a  long time but she knows that it is going  to be worth it in the end  she is now where she is meant to be  Ariel The Little Mermaid always wanted  to leave the sea to live on the land and  meeting the love of her life was the  last thing she needed to make that big  step after saving Prince Erik she knew  that she needed to meet this man again  this is why she decided to give away her  voice in exchange for a pair of legs  let's remember that she didn't even know  anything about that guy at that time it  wasn't easy to get used to this new  world without being able to communicate  and it didn't help when Ursula decided  to take her place next to Erik but the  Prince finally recognized who the  love of his life truly was and the two  ended up happily ever after in college  Arielle still can't help falling in love  over and over again even if she is  studying marine biology she can't resist  the temptation to look at this handsome  guy in European history class she is  ready to do anything for him including  changing program to make sure that they  are both in the same class don't do that  girl that's not a good idea no boy is  ever worth changing who you truly are  but that is something that everyone is  going to live in college and you have to  make mistakes to learn from them  Jasmin she was probably the luckiest  Disney princess but living in a palace  wasn't enough for her Jasmine didn't  want to live a beautiful life she just  wanted to live for real no one was going  to tell her what to do and certainly not  who she was supposed to marry this is  why she decided to escape to see what  the world outside of her palace looked  like she then met Aladdin and the two  immediately fell in love with each other  he gave her the chance to escape on a  magic carpet and discovering this whole  new world was all this girl ever wanted  no need to make three wishes when you  can only make one stay together forever  in college jasmine is still the kind of  girl who wants to be a little wild  after years of homeschooling she is  finally living far away from her father  and she has the chance to do whatever  she wants when you look at how Renzo  Ferrer reimagined her this girl looks  ready to go to a music festival and we  know that a lot of weird things are  happening there this girl is still young  so it is the best time to make these  kinds of experiences it's by going out  of your comfort zone that you can find  who you are and maybe even find love  Rapunzel this girl spent almost 18 years  trapped in a tower so she knows how to  keep herself busy she woke up at 7 in  the morning  cleaned her room and read two or three  books then it was time for her daily  activities like playing guitar cooking  dancing and brushing her hair but what  she loved the most was painting all over  her room like a Windows that gave her  the  to see what the outside world looked  like and then she did the same thing  every day all over again it must have  been really hard for her to live alone  in this tower but she did more things in  one day than what we can do in a week  this is why we bet that when Rapunzel  goes to college she will be part of  every club and participate in all the  activities we don't know if it is part  of her magic power but this girl just  finds a way to beat everywhere at the  same time young 86 reimagined Rapunzel  as a girl who loves everything she is  studying fashion and design and when she  is not at school  you can still see her drawing sewing  sculpting and crafting we just hope that  she has some time left to have a social  life because we would love to become her  best friend  Pocahontas as a Native American nature  was her school and grandmother willow  was her teacher with her friends the  raccoon and the hummingbirds the  daughter of the chief came to visit the  willow tree and this is when she found  out that the English were arriving when  they came to visit her home they thought  that they were more civilized than the  people who had been living in America  during all this time but Pocahontas was  actually the one who had to teach them  something instead of destroying the land  she told John Smith about the beauty of  nature and this is how they bonded  fascinated by each others worlds  unfortunately the two friends ended up  being separated and we think that it was  better this way but what if this story  happened centuries after this time the  Native American princess uses something  else to show others how she sees the  world  Renzo Ferrer reimagined her as a  photographer and she is cooler than ever  Pocahontas will never forget her origins  and this is why she loves taking  pictures of the world around her to make  the memories last forever there are so  many things that you can learn when you  understand how other people think which  Disney princess would be your best  friend in college don't be shy to answer  in the comments section down below we  love to hear what you think and that's  it for 10 Disney Princesses reimagined  as college  if you want to see more stories like  this make sure to watch 10 Disney movies  reimagined in the modern day thanks for  watching  [Music]

